---
layout: base
title: Notes
description: "Weekly notes and shorter updates from around life, work, and the independent web."
pagination:
  data: collections.notes
  size: 10
  alias: items
permalink: "/notes/{% if pagination.pageNumber > 0 %}page-{{ pagination.pageNumber + 1 }}/{% endif %}"
---

<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">&#128221; Notes</h1>
  <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-6">Shorter updates, weekly notes, and posts that do not need to be full essays to be worth keeping.</p>

  {% if items | length == 0 %}
    <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 italic">No notes yet.</p>
  {% else %}
    <section class="space-y-6">
      {% for item in items %}
        <article class="border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 pb-4 h-entry">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">
            <a class="u-url hover:text-blue-600" href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title or 'Untitled' }}</a>
          </h2>
          {% if item.date %}
            <time class="text-xs text-gray-500 dt-published" datetime="{{ item.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ item.date | readableDate }}</time>
          {% endif %}
          {% if item.data.description %}
            <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 p-summary">{{ item.data.description }}</p>
          {% endif %}
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </section>

    <nav class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-between" aria-label="Pagination">
      {% if pagination.href.previous %}
        <a class="px-4 py-2 rounded bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-200" href="{{ pagination.href.previous }}">Newer</a>
      {% else %}
        <span class="px-4 py-2 text-gray-400">Newer</span>
      {% endif %}

      <span class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">Page {{ pagination.pageNumber + 1 }} of {{ pagination.pages | length }}</span>

      {% if pagination.href.next %}
        <a class="px-4 py-2 rounded bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 hover:bg-gray-200" href="{{ pagination.href.next }}">Older</a>
      {% else %}
        <span class="px-4 py-2 text-gray-400">Older</span>
      {% endif %}
    </nav>
  {% endif %}
</div>
